er/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T11:10:51-07:00","id":170895,"title":"","content":"I'm all enthused about <i>Flowers</i>, so ...<br /> <br /> Mildly curious it is..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1488-skeltem","name":"Skeltem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1488_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T11:14:09-07:00","id":170898,"title":"","content":"I also hope that the Lucifuge would stay out of that. Maybe an hint or two, but nothing conclusive.<br /> <br /> Also, only I find it interesting that the children of the demons are called Heirs to Hell? I mean, demons could spend their entire life in search for an &quot;Hell&quot;, while for their children, it is their birthright. Sure, I may be reading too much in that, but for some reason I feel that the children have a better connection/ right to rule Hell than their parents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T11:19:22-07:00","id":170903,"title":"","content":"I think that there will be demon-children in the book titled &quot;Heirs to Hell.&quot; I doubt that they're the only thing covered in the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T12:38:32-07:00","id":170968,"title":"","content":"Very excited; I adored D:tD but prefer a much lower power level for my games. If the Heirs (or whatever name they end up with) are anything like what we're seeing of Wolf-Blooded in Idigam, then I'll be oh-so-pleased.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T13:04:22-07:00","id":170983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/170798-heirs-to-hell-super-hype-thread?p=170876#post170876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">BEST QUESTION: What is the main reason, in y'alls opinion, I will want to play the child of an Unchained as of Heirs to Hell?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're as excited about the one thing I know of out of the book as I am, that will answer this question all on its own. (Which I know is a bit coy, and I don't mean to be a dick about it - simply saying that there is one thing in there that I know about and I freaking love. It makes me want to play one of these just to use that mechanic, let's put it that way. I can't say any more than that though because Matt has my address. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T17:46:52-07:00","id":171232,"title":"","content":"Rose Bailey is being tricksy. The front page of the forums tells me she replied to this thread, but I see no such reply! Devious.<br /> <br /> My ongoing Demon chronicle (though it's been facing trouble for the past month getting everybody together) gives me special reason to look forward to Heirs. The organizer of the local agency is an elderly watchmaker whose Fall was particularly far-reaching in its effects: it solidified into existence his extended family, who existed previously only as notional aspects of his angelic cover. Upkeep errors caused the Machine to identify the Ludd family as potential assets for situating new angelic agents in cover, and so they ended up with another angel as the first demon's &quot;granddaughter.&quot; This angel, later Fallen herself, is my character.<br /> <br /> So what of her father and siblings? Her older brother's strange experiences and expanding senses? What are they, really, and do they realize it?<br /> <br /> It's gonna be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T20:35:12-07:00","id":171341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/170798-heirs-to-hell-super-hype-thread?p=170883#post170883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Probably nothing because changelings are way infertile <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but imagine what happens if a demon and a changeling use the River of Dead Seed to create a baby?</div> </div> </div> </div>Those stories don't end well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-16T20:39:55-07:00","id":171345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/170798-heirs-to-hell-super-hype-thread?p=170983#post170983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If you're as excited about the one thing I know of out of the book as I am, that will answer this question all on its own. (Which I know is a bit coy, and I don't mean to be a dick about it - simply saying that there is one thing in there that I know about and I freaking love. It makes me want to play one of these just to use that mechanic, let's put it that way. I can't say any more than that though because Matt has my address. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )</div> </div> </div> </div>Slip the information out via an encoded message that praises Promethean!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock"