ference to the still unannounced Demon Dark Era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T18:34:15-07:00","id":173444,"title":"","content":"Okay, I don't wanna add to naff 'hype' if I can help it, but...<br /> <br /> <i>Heirs to Hell</i> is worth the hype! Sure, I wish it were longer, and I want more art. Still, I don't want it MUCH longer, and the art in there is so lovely (as is <b>Demon: the Descent</b>'s art) that I just want MOAR!!!<br /> <br /> Yeah, it's really lovely. That's what I'm saying here. Now get back to your hype.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T18:50:49-07:00","id":173466,"title":"","content":"I already finished it! Loved it!<br /> <br /> Admittedly, there are things I find a little skeevy, but I'm about 75% percent sure that's an overactive creeper sense after getting burned by CthulhuTech, and even if it isn't, it's forgivable for being both unavoidable (pregnancy and all that), and handled very tastefully for RPGs to begin with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:02:59-07:00","id":173476,"title":"","content":"Did I miss something in CthulhuTech?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:05:27-07:00","id":173478,"title":"","content":"There <i>is</i> at least one <i>Dark Eras</i> reference in the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethru