ntent":"Just started reading, but it occurs to me that it might be worth taking a look at current FX series THE AMERICANS for inspiration, given its focus on the family life/children of two undercover agents. Soviets instead of demons, of course, but the point remains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/361-brighthand","name":"Brighthand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:43:47-07:00","id":173522,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know whether Heirs to Hell will come out eventually as a POD product?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Games - <a href=\"https://dust-and-shadow.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Dust and Shadow</a> (Vampire)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/626-darkfool","name":"DarkFool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar626_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:47:30-07:00","id":173523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkFool</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/170798-heirs-to-hell-super-hype-thread?p=173522#post173522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone know whether Heirs to Hell will come out eventually as a POD product?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, it will. Pretty much everything we do is released in PoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:48:30-07:00","id":173525,"title":"","content":"I like the art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:52:41-07:00","id":173534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/170798-heirs-to-hell-super-hype-thread?p=173525#post173525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the art.</div> </div> </div> </div>I REALLY LIKE HER MANE![/brony]<br /> <br /> But seriously, the artwork is fantastic, and I've finished the first two chapters and GRAH! I want to play one so bad. I want to play a demon parent really bad! I WANT TO PLAY GAMES WITH THIS.<br /> <br /> With all due respect to the game that finally made me like bloodsuckers, WHY AM I RUNNING BLOOD AND SMOKE WHEN I COULD BE RUNNING DEMON?!(Translated: Why am I running an excellent game when I could be running an excellent game?!)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-18T19:54:07-07:00","id":173536,"title":"","content":"One thing I gotta love is how this book expands the <i>Demon </i>universe, to the point where it can really stand on its own and be fascinating in its depth. Angels, Demons, Stigmatics, Cryptids, Exiles, mortal psychics, the Deva Corporation, Utopia Now, the Knights of Saint Adrian, and three flavors of Demon-Blooded really give a wide enough variety of NPCs to never really want for much in terms of variety. And that's before we drag <i>qas